ative","src/analyze/planner/templates/docs/index.ts","checkpoint: attempt 2 completedChunks scope"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["scope","planner","verification","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"planner","findingId":"planner-001"},"rationale":"The current contract explicitly preserves primary-only repetition semantics. The secondary-to-primary transition now correctly receives no banner, and its regression coverage is specified.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:62-73,138-140,165,177","src/analyze/planner/driver.ts:343-358,524-559","checkpoint: attempt 2 completedChunks planner and verification"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["planner","verification","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"planner","findingId":"planner-002"},"rationale":"Both current representations document the existing single RunPlannerArgs object, including the optional provider, matching the implementation.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:91-108",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-1c09e09cd985026b-s1.json: /body/contractDetails/api/3","src/analyze/planner/driver.ts:164-183"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["planner","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"verification","findingId":"verification-001"},"rationale":"The revised strategy now specifies the missing docs-catalog INV-7-plus-count, INV-11, then valid sequence with primary-only feedback assertions. Its remaining inability to prove production correction delivery is captured more precisely by current verification-003, because the chosen scripted hook bypasses the message/provider branch.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:179-181,191","src/analyze/planner/driver.ts:171-181,218-235,269-286,374","checkpoint: attempt 2 completedChunks verification, finding verification-003"],"action":"superseded","reviewedInChunkIds":["verification","consistency"],"supersededBy":{"chunkId":"verification","findingId":"verification-003"}},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"verification","findingId":"verification-