empt description when implementing the separate planner budget.","No diagram or UX rendering is necessary for these internal policy and correction-message changes; prose adequately describes dependencies and ownership. Tests and live services were not executed during this read-only review."],"findingDecisions":[{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"scope","findingId":"scope-001"},"rationale":"The revised design makes the previously deferred policy decision: retain bands with a parameterized-catalog rationale, introduce five planner attempts independently of wire repair, and require live validation with a band-revisit trigger. Acceptance expectations now address the complete ISSUE fix intent.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:105-114,176-191,230-256",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-1c09e09cd985026b-s1.json: /body/alternativesConsidered/2, /body/chosenAlternative","src/analyze/planner/templates/docs/index.ts","checkpoint: attempt 2 completedChunks scope"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["scope","planner","verification","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"planner","findingId":"planner-001"},"rationale":"The current contract explicitly preserves primary-only repetition semantics. The secondary-to-primary transition now correctly receives no banner, and its regression coverage is specified.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:62-73,138-140,165,177","src/analyze/planner/driver.ts:343-358,524-559","checkpoint: attempt 2 completedChunks planner and verification"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["planner","verification","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"planner","findingId":"planner-002"},"rationale":"Both current representations document the existing single RunPlannerArgs object, including the optional provider, matching the implementation.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:91-108",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-1c09e09cd985026b-s1.json: /body/contractDetails/api/3","src/analyze/planner/driver.ts:164-183"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["planner",